# Company Profile — Northstar Prepared Foods

Northstar Prepared Foods manages private-label ingredient programs for large restaurant and retail prepared-food accounts in North America. The commercial team bids seasonal supply programs for bakery toppings, seed blends, sauce inclusions, and shelf-stable garnish kits.

The company works through approved sourcing channels rather than owning farms. Procurement tracks source qualification, allocation windows, lead times, certification coverage, and price-escalation limits. Customer commitments are concentrated in a few national accounts, and missed contracting windows can forfeit high-margin seasonal programs.


Product catalog:
- Bakery Topping Allocation — seed and grain topping supply for seasonal prepared-food programs.
- Sauce Inclusion Kit — shelf-stable inclusions for limited-time menu launches.
- Garnish Pack Program — packaged garnish inputs for retail prepared-food counters.
- Sweet Crumb Inclusion — bakery inclusion blend for cafe and retail accounts.
- Savory Finish Blend — dry finishing blend for prepared-food assembly lines.

